## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- Timeframe: M5 primary; P3 sweep can try M1/M3.
- Symbol shortlist for P2 baseline: EURUSD.DWX, GBPUSD.DWX, EURGBP.DWX (London-overlap
  pairs).
- Range window 03:00-09:00 ET, execution 09:30-11:00 ET, exit-all 11:00 ET — convert all
  three to broker time via TimeGMT + DST table.
- 5-tick stop = 5 pips for FX (after `_Digits` normalization). P3 sweep can test 7-pip /
  10-pip / range-fraction.
- 2R TP is fixed-ratio; expectancy depends on win-rate × 2 > 1.
